{"synopsis":"Han Jungmin yang hanya unggul dalam ujian tertulis menyerah menjadi seorang petualang karena dia tidak memiliki bakat Setelah mengambil cuti dari akademi petualang dan saat dia mulai menulis novel fantasi Anda telah dijiplak oleh dunia Kelas unik  penulis cerita dimulai suatu hari novel yang ditulis Jungmin mulai menjadi kenyataan dan mendapat pekerjaan sebagai penulis cerita Selain itu Satusatunya kemampuan unik yang terbuka keahlian khusus yang tidak dimiliki orang lain Bisakah Jungmin mencapai mimpinya menjadi petualang penjara bawah tanah","alternative_title":"Heir of a legendary hero, Successor of Mythical Heroes,","author":"-Flavored Miso, Jagam, Jinka, WON","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"58fb0663-ad97-480a-afdd-3d2a0cedf284","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"a272165f-687b-4bc5-a418-d1f240de7273","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"7ff91d22-ef25-4486-8270-4cc90b3ad4c0","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"6ab1723d-f1cc-424d-a689-7b9c6b5282c9","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"5e3e3164-0f95-43ad-afad-b9ca9f19c13e","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"08c78be5-d934-4cc4-b04b-ad7a44b82249","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"1900539e-13d6-44c6-97cd-9d84d6a48121","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24"},{"chapter_id":"fa6628a8-d174-47c6-98b0-32c080dc89e8","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"7f379fc4-e309-4e63-b29b-dd30fa1f4228","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"dd9d622b-ce36-4e05-862b-e87c260b6